<title>MEXICO: Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.05 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico TIIE 28-day rate rises to 26.05 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate (TIIE) rose to 26.05 percent on Thursday from Wednesday's rate of 26.0050 percent, the Mexican Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate, revised daily.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9558</p>
</text>
